OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FWords by ITV News Producer Andy Ward
OL,8,FThe 2026 World Cup may be over, but
OL,9,Fthe controversy certainly isn't after
OL,10,FFifa was accused of putting football's
OL,11,Fbiggest tournament "up for sale".
OL,13,FIn a bombshell statement on Tuesday,
OL,14,FFifa President Gianni Infantino
OL,15,Frevealed that he is seeking to create
OL,16,Fa $20 billion (about #14.93 billion)
OL,17,Fcompany which would run future World
OL,18,FCups with private investors, including
OL,19,Fthe Kushner family, who have links to
OL,20,FUS President Donald Trump.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/15
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1785341897
OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FFifa has argued the proposal would
OL,7,Fhelp to grow the game globally, but
OL,8,Fthose against it fear it would give
OL,9,Ftoo much power to third parties.
OL,11,FHere is everything you need to know
OL,12,Fabout the plan and what it could mean
OL,13,Ffor football.
OL,15,FWhat is Fifa's plan?
OL,17,FIn simple terms, Fifa is proposing to
OL,18,Fsell stakes in its major competitions
OL,19,F- including the World Cup - to private
OL,20,Fbackers.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/15
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1785341897
OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FIt wants to set up a new private
OL,7,Fcompany, called Fifa Forward
OL,8,FEnterprise (FFE), which would take
OL,9,Fcontrol of all commercial and event
OL,10,Foperations - including the World Cup.
OL,12,F"Carefully selected" investors would
OL,13,Fthen be invited to "make minority, non-
OL,14,Fcontrolling investments" - a move that
OL,15,FFifa estimates would raise $4.2
OL,16,Fbillion (#3.2 billion), Infantino was
OL,17,Fquoted as saying in Fifa's statement
OL,18,Fon the plan.
OL,26,@vD@XO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/15
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
