CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1785341897
OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FThat money would be offered to all 211
OL,7,Fof Fifa's member associations (see
OL,8,Ffull list here), who will be able to
OL,9,Faccess a one-off lump sum of $20
OL,10,Fmillion (#15 million) to help develop
OL,11,Ffootball in their respective countries.
OL,13,F"Every Fifa member association should
OL,14,Fhave an opportunity to seek a fair
OL,15,Fshare of the available funding to
OL,16,Fshape its own future, deciding for
OL,17,Fitself rather than relying on others,"
OL,18,FInfantino said
OL,26,@uD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/15
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1785341897
OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,F"This is about the democratisation of
OL,7,Ffootball worldwide. We intend to
OL,8,Finvest heavily even in the smallest or
OL,9,Fmost remote parts of the footballing
OL,10,Fworld, places that are too often
OL,11,Fpassed over."
OL,13,FFifa has insisted it would remain the
OL,14,Fgame's global governing body and would
OL,15,Fretain a majority stake in FFE. In
OL,16,Fother words, it would still be in
OL,17,Fcharge of sporting decisions.
OL,19,FIf the scheme is to get the green
OL,20,Flight, it will require the backing of
OL,21,Fthe majority of Fifa's members.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/15
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
