FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1785341897
OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FInfantino said on Wednesday that
OL,7,Ffootball associations will have until
OL,8,FSeptember 19 to accept his plan if
OL,9,Fthey want to access their initial #15
OL,10,Fmillion payment, which would be
OL,11,F"available immediately" from January
OL,12,F2027.
OL,14,FHe also stressed that any associations
OL,15,Fwho reject the scheme would miss out
OL,16,Fon a $40 million (#30 million) total
OL,17,Fpackage, which would see their
OL,18,Fearnings drop by at least 75%.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/15
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1785341897
OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FIn response to Infantino's ultimatum,
OL,7,FEuropean football's governing body
OL,8,FUefa said it was aware of "growing
OL,9,Fopposition" to the plan and called for
OL,10,Fassociations to "grow the game
OL,11,Fcorrectly."
OL,13,F"Today we have learned of Fifa's
OL,14,Fdeadline to associations to support
OL,15,Ftheir proposals or have the one-off
OL,16,Fpayout offer withdrawn. This says
OL,17,Feverything you need to know about this
OL,18,Fplan," a spokesperson said.
OL,20,FWhat has the reaction been like?
OL,26,@uD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/15
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
