OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1785341897
OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FFrosty, to put it lightly.
OL,8,FIn the wake of Tuesday's announcement,
OL,9,FUefa was quick to issue a scathing
OL,10,Fstatement criticising the proposal,
OL,11,Fsaying that it "crosses a line that
OL,12,Ffootball's governing institutions
OL,13,Fshould never cross".
OL,15,FIt also insisted that the World Cup is
OL,16,Fnot an "asset to trade" and may even
OL,17,Flead to the confederation boycotting
OL,18,Ffuture tournaments.
OL,26,@sD@POUuD@SO]xD@HOUxD@WO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/15
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
