OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1785341897
OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FThat would be hugely damaging to the
OL,7,Fcompetition's integrity considering
OL,8,Fthat six of the eight quarter-
OL,9,Ffinalists at this summer's World Cup,
OL,10,Fincluding winners Spain, were European.
OL,12,FIt's understood that Uefa will hold an
OL,13,Femergency meeting with all of its 55
OL,14,Fmembers on Thursday to discuss what to
OL,15,Fdo next.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/15
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
