OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1785341897
OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FOther governing bodies were equally
OL,7,Fperplexed, not least Concacaf, the
OL,8,Fconfederation of North, Central
OL,9,FAmerica and the Caribbean, who said it
OL,10,Fhad only found out about the plans
OL,11,F"through media reports and,
OL,12,Fsubsequently, via a media release".
OL,14,FThat lack of communication seems to be
OL,15,Fa running theme, with The Football
OL,16,FAssociation saying on Wednesday that
OL,17,Fit was "completely unaware" of the
OL,18,Fproposal and was "deeply concerned
OL,19,Fabout the lack of process and
OL,20,Fgovernance to get to this point."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/15
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
