OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FThe plan has promoted an angry
OL,7,Freaction from politicians as well,
OL,8,Fincluding new Prime Minister Andy
OL,9,FBurnham who said on X: "Football does
OL,10,Fnot belong to investors. It belongs to
OL,11,Fthe people who fill the stands and who
OL,12,Fstand on the touchline week in, week
OL,13,Fout, rain or shine."
OL,15,FCould Uefa really organise a boycott?
OL,17,FIn theory, yes. But it won't be easy.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G11/15
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1785341897
OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FUefa is the unifying body for Europe's
OL,7,F55 member associations, and it would
OL,8,Fneed agreement from all 55 to be able
OL,9,Fto cut ties with Fifa completely.
OL,11,FThat feels unlikely though because
OL,12,Fmany of the smaller European countries
OL,13,Fwould find the money proposed by Fifa
OL,14,Ftoo good to turn down.
OL,16,FUefa does have the power to fine or
OL,17,Feven ban national associations that
OL,18,Fdisagree with their stance, but again,
OL,19,Fall 55 members would have to
OL,20,Fcollectively pass a resolution before
OL,21,Fit reaches that stage.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G12/15
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30413
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1785341897
OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FThere is the option of some of the
OL,7,Fbigger European nations like England,
OL,8,FSpain, France or Germany forming a
OL,9,Fpact to boycott a World Cup - but self-
OL,10,Finterest could then come to the fore.
OL,12,FIf many of the big-hitters are missing
OL,13,Ffrom a tournament, other countries may
OL,14,Fspot a golden opportunity to go for
OL,15,Fglory, and pull out of any agreement.
OL,17,FHas anything similar been done in
OL,18,Fother sports?
OL,20,FAbsolutely. In fact, we've seen this
OL,21,Fin football before.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G13/15
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
