OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FIn 2021, Spain's domestic league, La
OL,7,FLiga, agreed to sell a 10% share of
OL,8,Fits business to Luxembourg-based
OL,9,Fprivate equity firm CVC Capital
OL,10,FPartners for E2.7 billion (#2.3
OL,11,Fbillion).
OL,13,FAt the time, the league said the deal
OL,14,Fwould help give clubs more funds to
OL,15,Fspend on new infrastructure and
OL,16,Fincrease how much they could spend on
OL,17,Fplayer salaries.
OL,19,FIn the UK, rugby's PREM struck a
OL,20,Fsimilar deal with the same company in
OL,21,F2018.
OL,26,@rD@NOk
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G14/15
