OL,3,CWhat is Fifa's World Cup plan and what
OL,4,Ccould it mean?
OL,6,FOn that occasion, CVC bought a 27%
OL,7,Fstake worth more than #200 million.
OL,9,FGolf's PGA Tour also announced a $3
OL,10,Fbillion (#2.36 billion) private equity
OL,11,Fdeal with the Strategic Sports Group
OL,12,F(SSG), a consortium led by Fenway
OL,13,FSports Group, in 2024, while Formula
OL,14,FOne is another sport that has welcomed
OL,15,Fprivate equity investment.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G15/15
